<title>CANADA: Leitch shareholders approve stock split.</title>
<headline>Leitch shareholders approve stock split.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leitch Technology Corp said on Wednesday that its shareholders have approved a one-for-two split of the company's common shares.</p>
<p>Leitch said in a statement the stock split was approved at the company's annual meeting today.</p>
<p>The company's stock is expected to begin trading on a split basis on September 24.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
